<title>UK: Diploma says buys 80 pct in Texas firm.</title>
<headline>Diploma says buys 80 pct in Texas firm.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Engineering company Diploma Plc said on Friday it had bought 80 percent stake in a Texas-based steel firm, Carbon &amp; Alloy Metals Inc, for a cash consideration of 3.4 million pounds ($5.5 million).</p>
<p>Carbon &amp; Alloys reported a pre-tax profit of a million pounds for the year to September 30, 1996 with its net assets valued at 2.2 million pounds as of that date.</p>
<p>($ = 0.616 British Pounds)</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
</text>
